e5-4832-92fd-37614220b427":{"id":"d993f789-e7e5-4832-92fd-37614220b427","title":"The Skeleton Soldier Failed to Defend the Dungeon","altTitle":"Skeleton Soldier","description":"The Skeleton Soldier is a meager but fiercely loyal fighter who serves to protect its master, Lady Succubus. Its dream of a peaceful life with her is shattered when they're both brutally murdered by a group of warriors one day.\n\nBut what would’ve been a pathetic end to an unremarkable soul sparks a new beginning: when the Skeleton Soldier opens its eyes again, it has traveled back 20 years in time!\n\n\"I must warn Lady Succubus of all the things to come!\"\n\nBut with no special combat skills and a history of failure and defeat, how can it stop the horrible events from unfolding again?\n\nFollow the Skeleton Soldier as it faces the most challenging quest of all — rewriting the ending to its own story.","year":2018,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d993f789-e7e5-4832-92fd-37614220b427/7e02ac66-1ac9-4eac-bc05-a264222ca87b.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pt-br","es-la","it","fr","en","pl","ru","fa","cs","id"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.4,"follows":82841,"listAt":"2026-10-23T18:59:36.303Z","chapters":[{"id":"cf82e6b3-f029-4229-8d3a-c6d1eb83d7b2","number":"36","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2025-05-16T20:33:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2cb6c639-033e-4064-a3fd-dacbe0aaaaad","number":"25","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2018-09-21T07:19:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:27:02.405Z"},"189f97d3-2e2e-4d37-ba55-9702b7f89d78":{"id":"189f97d3-2e2e-4d37-ba55-9702b7f89d78","title":"Sekai o Sukutte mo Onaka wa Suku kara","altTitle":"Even If We Save The World, We'll Still Be Hungry","description":"Dua puluh tahun setelah mengalahkan Raja Iblis, elf bernama Shia, salah satu anggota party pahlawan, menjalani kehidupan tenang sebagai pertapa jauh di dalam hutan.\nSuatu hari, seseorang tiba-tiba datang menemuinya. Orang itu adalah Rina, penyihir yang dulu pernah bertualang bersamanya.\n\"Mau pergi bertualang sekali lagi? Kali ini... cuma kita berdua.\"\nDemi mengisi kekosongan yang bahkan tak bisa dipenuhi meski telah menyelamatkan dunia, keduanya kembali memulai perjalanan mengelilingi dunia.\n\nKisah slow life fantasy yang dibalut dengan kuliner dari dunia lain pun dimulai!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Adventure","Girls' Love","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/189f97d3-2e2e-4d37-ba55-9702b7f89d78/aa8af459-4874-4763-957b-25704b3e00d3.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["vi","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.49,"follows":2841,"listAt":"2026-10-21T07:08:19.347Z","chapters":[{"id":"3738cd1b-c23d-4efb-a9a4-b6124d14d1d1","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T13:10:11+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3f357add-e45c-4791-bb0a-98b16a40597c","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2026-09-15T12:15:34+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b0012d81-a264-4c48-9e2a-aa0b132d206e","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-08-13T14:48:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"60cd6b04-ecda-4801-8de6-bd8de7ab7325","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2026-07-15T14:04:45+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:59.058Z"},"7f179f8e-f169-43bc-acc3-61f0a9e93c83":{"id":"7f179f8e-f169-43bc-acc3-61f0a9e93c83","title":"Marginal Operation Zenshi: Haruka Toudo no Canaan","altTitle":"The Founding of the Promised Land","description":null,"year":2017,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"18","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Action"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/