0:00","baked":false},{"id":"9984e1a6-44c6-4354-85ee-d7955bd34e87","number":"6","volume":"2","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":41,"createdAt":"2026-06-12T19:07:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"cbf46cee-82a6-4235-b3f3-8b5e210065ab","number":"5.5","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-05-19T19:51:45+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e345a031-5755-4428-b1a9-d4bdb1d8dbbd","number":"5","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-05-18T20:19:10+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3a5726d8-8db9-4040-abf0-fcb1fcc99b46","number":"4","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-05-17T22:07:55+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"11e76c10-97df-48a4-a0e1-fb22d7899da8","number":"3","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-05-12T21:00:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"884501cc-1214-4679-9124-c4ab1f4bcd00","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2026-05-10T00:51:27+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3a2af386-17ce-491f-9b0d-cfd32a1d6649","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-04-16T20:28:33+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":18,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:31:18.119Z"},"f4f3f5f6-903e-4114-ae0f-dfbf3747a22d":{"id":"f4f3f5f6-903e-4114-ae0f-dfbf3747a22d","title":"2019 Rookie Danpyeonseon: Jiok Camp","altTitle":"2019 Rookie Short Story - Hell Camp","description":"The anthology includes:\n1. Momo Cinnamon (모모 시나몬, Momo) by Yun-Su Lee\n2. Wangbi (왕비; Queen) by Yeong-Chae Hae\n\nEveryone knows how the fairy tale ends. A true love's kiss awakens the slumbering Snow White, who then lives happily ever after with her prince. After all, main characters always get their happy endings.  \n  \nBut what happens to the evil queen after? Exiled to the isolated, bleak Northern island, she awaits her execution; thirty days of waiting, with only a nonchalant guard as company. If she is to live, she must find a way out. Will she be able to escape in time, defying all odds? Or will she succumb to fate?\n\n[MangaUpdates](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/kugmnnf)\n\n3. Nancy wa Lara (낸시와 라라; Nancy and Lara) by Ri-Geon Lee\n4. Yeouhaegol (여우해골) by Su-Seong Yu\n5. Be my baby by Gon-Ji\n\n[MangaUpdates](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/0l362ec/be-my-baby)\n\n6. Eomma (엄마; Mom) by Samgueok\n7. Oraeorae Haengbokage Saratseumnida?! (오래오래 행복하게 살았습니다?!; Will We Live Happily Ever After?!) by Jep Park\n\nPrincess Dam Jin finds out she's going to be married off to a prince from a neighbouring kingdom, so she enlists the help of her loyal maid Seohyeon to make the wedding a failure.\n\n8. Najungmalgo Jigeum! (나중말고 지금!; Not Later, Now!) by SONNA\n9. Bimildongmaeng (비밀동맹; A Secret Alliance) by Du-O\n10. Immatchumeul Heoyonghagesseoyo (입맞춤을 허용하겠어요; I’ll Let You Kiss Me, Can I Kiss You?, Você me permitiria beijar-te?) by Seo-Yeon\n\n[MangaUpdates](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/m0xbwqf/can-i-kiss-you), [Anime-Planet](https://www.anime-planet.com/manga/can-i-kiss-you), [Kitsu](https://kitsu.app/manga/can-i-kiss-you)\n\n11. Ttangeseo Umteun Nalgae (땅에서 움튼 날개; Wings From the Ground) by Hyeon-Jeong Kim\n12. Eung, Ni Eolgul (응, 니 얼굴; Yeah, Your Face) by Nongyung10\n13. Boineungeot (보이는것; What You See) by Ga-Yeon Kim\n14. Eo Dark Sini-ui Sowon (어둑시니의 소원; The Dark Sini’s Wish) by ZQ\n15. Noineul Wihan Naraneun Eopda (노인을 위한 나라는 없다; There Is No Country for the Elderly) by ALTZ\n16. Going Home by Sin-Jin\n17. Goyangipyeonuijeom (고양이편의점; Cat Convenience Store) by So-Yeon Cha\n18. Gureume Garin Dal (구름에 가린 달; The Moon Hidden by Clouds) by Nagyeopbeoseot\n19. Myeolmanggwa Silheomui Huisaengyang (멸망과 실험의 희생양; The Scapegoat for Destruction and Experimentation) by Meotjinsegye\n20. Jjaksarang Jeonmunga K Yang (짝사랑 전문가 K 양; K, the One-Sided Love Expert) by Gonggonggugong\n21. Yuriro Mandeun Jip (유리로 만든 집; A Glass House) by Jin-Yu\n22. Taeyangi Nal Wihae Naerijjoeji Aneuna (태양이 날 위해 내리쬐지 않으나; The Sun Shines for Me) by Nallo\n23. Gyeolhonjeonya (결혼전야; The Day Before the Wedding) by Min-Gyeong Kim\n24. Chadichanmaeum (차디찬마음; A Cold Heart) by Soyom","year":2019,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"24","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Romance","Comedy","Girls' Love","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f4f3f5f6-903e-4114-ae0f-dfbf3747a22d/f17ba172-45df-465f-a98a-090b119fb4da.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pt-br","en","fr","es-la","uk","tr","hu","vi"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.84,"follows":3755,"listAt":"2026-10-23T18:59:31.186Z","chapters":[{"id":"5ae98c15-ba02-46ce-b66b-d5ce2f829108","number":"10","volume":null,"title":"Can I Kiss You?","lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2020-11-09T00:48:24+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3deae796-63d0-4c96-a381-977c69099255","number":"7","volume":null,"title":"Will We Live Happily Ever After?","lang":"en","pages":72,"createdAt":"2021-01-08T23:18:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1402fc8d-589f-4dc1-a946-3dcc616d324e","number":"5","volume":null,"title":"Be my baby!","lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2021-02-12T23:38:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"aaa620da-10dc-4493-b3fb-5bcd68841f4b","number":"1","volume":null,"title":"Momo","lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2019-09-21T01:42:27+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:47.930Z"},"09656afb-aaf9-4f9b-95fd-873cb537ddc3":{"id":"09656afb-aaf9-4f9b-95fd-873cb537ddc3","title":"Gwangma Hoegwi","altTitle":"The Return of the Crazy Demon","description":"The Mad Demon, Lee Zaha, dreams of becoming the God of Martial Arts. Unfortunately, his dreams are dashed after he falls off a cliff while running from the Demonic Cult for stealing the Jade of Heaven. \n\nYet this is not the end for Jaha - he awakens from the fall to find himself back in his 20s. With his knowledge of the future and of martial arts, he now has a chance at revenge and at getting life right this time. \n\nWill he be able to fulfill his dream this time around, or is he doomed to face the same fate yet again?\n\n---\n\n- [Official Traditional Chinese Translation](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/action/mad-demon/list?title_no=3510)\n\n- [Official Simplified Chinese Translation](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/BOY/kuangmochongsheng/list?title_no=1842)\n\n- [Official Japanese Translation](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0001777)\n\n- [Official Thai Translation](https://www.webtoons.com/th/fantasy/return-of-the-mad-demon/list?title_no=3957)","year":2021,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Thriller","Historical","Action","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/09656afb-aaf9-4f9b-95fd-873cb537ddc3/e40d1077-be07-4923-a7b7-8fab68d400e8.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["hu","es-la","pl","pt-br","it","fa","uk","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":9.13,"follows":5377,"listAt":"2026-10-23T18:59:36.303Z","chapters":[{"id":"f876b264-2ca4-407d-a867-bd2b76c7ae24","number":"168","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2025-09-05T21:26:38+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:30.715Z"},"955091d9-55d6-4f56-8735-70a0fe1fb751":{"id":"955091d9-55d6-4f56-8735-70a0fe1fb751","title":"Close and Secretive","altTitle":"Close Sneak","description":"On that day, I was going to confess to you. Choi Ji-young, an unidentified woman who accidentally encountered her on Ulleungdo Island. Sunwoo Hyun keeps bothering Ji-young. Two people who are attracted to each other even in a short period of time. Then one day, Ji-young suddenly disappears. Without a trace. “It’s been a while, Hyun. Aren’t you going to say hello?” Ji-young, who could not be found no matter how much she visited, became the “Choi Ji-an” and appeared in four years. That’s also for Hyun to protect. “With this time, there is no Choi Ji-young I knew. So, just delete it too.”","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"con