id":"aeffffd7-20cf-4bf4-854e-e2800a952f6a","title":"Kuriko to Biyori","altTitle":"くりことびより","description":"Sojiro, employed at a confectionery company, and his wife, Makoto, have joyfully opened their home to a foster child, Kuriko. But there's a catch – Kuriko seems to communicate mostly with a simple \"mhm,\" perhaps due to nerves.\n\nSojiro, who has vague memories of his own early childhood, struggles to bridge the gap between him and Kuriko. However, Kuriko harbors a deep fascination with Sojiro's special talent – crafting delectable sweets! The art of confectionery becomes the thread that weaves this family closer together.\n\nJoin this heartwarming journey of a seemingly disconnected parent and child as they evolve into a bonded \"family\".","year":2022,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"19","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Comedy","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/aeffffd7-20cf-4bf4-854e-e2800a952f6a/b36ddfcb-4cd0-46ae-827a-fa58fc768bcd.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.3,"follows":4644,"listAt":"2026-10-23T18:58:51.280Z","chapters":[{"id":"aba747d7-3630-479e-b37d-00fc9320f695","number":"10","volume":"2","title":"Nina's Tummy Rumbling","lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2026-10-22T20:22:31+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5d64fd38-6497-4e8c-8245-5185d3c6909d","number":"9","volume":"2","title":"Apple Power","lang":"en","pages":50,"createdAt":"2026-05-11T21:22:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"945c0e48-1be9-4a92-a110-e84f45236ad7","number":"8","volume":"2","title":"Fruit Jelly","lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2026-03-27T22:22:08+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"52a4536d-ec29-4441-bbc0-3b2122104f25","number":"7","volume":"2","title":"Crunchy Strawberry Candy","lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2026-02-02T00:04:13+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f7a98fab-200b-41ff-aa40-8ab95c008d7b","number":"6","volume":"2","title":"Chewy White Dango","lang":"en","pages":42,"createdAt":"20